{"unit_id":"zexadev__dsh-tether#card-zh","repo":"zexadev/dsh-tether","commit":"b68c5e397d48cb2a871205ab669d8adb70908751","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tether（DSH 移动客户端）：让 Android 或 iOS 手机访问电脑上运行的 DSH，也可在 Android arm64 手机上本地运行 DSH。电脑端插件启动 tether-host sidecar，通过 iroh 建立点对点连接并在需要时经 relay 转发，将完整 DSH Web 界面送入手机 App；插件还注入窄屏样式、提供配对与设备管理入口，并把待处理审批通知发到手机。适合需要离开电脑或没有电脑时继续使用 DSH 的开发者。远程模式需安装匹配平台的 sidecar；Android 本地模式自带运行时。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:160-197","index.js:390-425","app/src-tauri/src/lib.rs:90-180","app/ui/main.js:72-90"]}
{"unit_id":"zexadev__dsh-tether#card-en","repo":"zexadev/dsh-tether","commit":"b68c5e397d48cb2a871205ab669d8adb70908751","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Tether is a mobile DSH client. An iroh sidecar connects a phone to DSH on a computer and shows its full web UI. The app supports pairing, host management, mobile layouts and approval notifications. Android arm64 can also run DSH locally using its bundled runtime.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:160-197","index.js:390-425","app/src-tauri/src/lib.rs:90-180","app/ui/main.js:72-90"]}
